(7763127, 1286567, 30861, '<td valign="top">Jaysus! "Red in tooth &amp; claw" indeed... I''m guessing this is Jcar on the job :-)</td>', 'Jaysus! "Red in tooth & claw" indeed... I''m guessing this is Jcar on the job :-)', '2024-02-02 10:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763165, 1286567, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a rough photo, but its an exceptionally good capture. You must have one heck of a wildlife lens. Ive been to Yellowstone in the winter (assuming you took this there) and capturing wolves this well is REALLY hard. Good lord, the one is licking his chops. 10 for a Ntl Geo worthy moment</td>', 'This is a rough photo, but its an exceptionally good capture. You must have one heck of a wildlife lens. Ive been to Yellowstone in the winter (assuming you took this there) and capturing wolves this well is REALLY hard. Good lord, the one is licking his chops. 10 for a Ntl Geo worthy moment', '2024-02-03 08:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763166, 1286503, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is s beautifully captured! The processing, DOF, bravo!</td>', 'This is s beautifully captured! The processing, DOF, bravo!', '2024-02-03 08:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763167, 1286531, 66597, '<td valign="top">Er, Im glad the title indicated what this is, as I couldnt tell. Not gonna lie, the subject is a mess here. But nice bokeh, so 5</td>', 'Er, Im glad the title indicated what this is, as I couldnt tell. Not gonna lie, the subject is a mess here. But nice bokeh, so 5', '2024-02-03 08:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
